### 6. UTILITIES FOR PIXEL-ART GENERATION

**Key Helper Functions:**

| Function | File | Lines | Purpose |
|----------|------|-------|---------|
| `paintGrid()` | spritePixels.ts | 18-35 | Maps character grid + palette to RGBA pixels |
| `paintIsoBlock()` | spritePixels.ts | 544-589 | Generates shaded isometric cube for blocks |
| `pixelHash()` | spritePixels.ts | 38-41 | Deterministic per-pixel noise (used in both sprites & atlas) |
| `tone()` | atlas.ts | 21-23 | Multiplies RGB by factor + additive offset, clamps to [0,1] |
| `rgb()` | atlas.ts | 25-27 | Converts float RGB [0-1] to CSS `rgb()` string |
| `clampByte()` | spritePixels.ts | 43 | Clamps value to [0, 255] |
| `noiseTileUrl()` | chromeTiles.ts | 9-31 | Generates tileable noise texture as data URL |
| `halfIcon()` | hudPixels.ts | 92-105 | Blends left-half of full icon over container |
| `renderSkinPortraitPixels()` | skinPortrait.ts | 33-45 | Paints bust portrait from palette |
| `buildExtrudedSpriteGeometry()` | extrudedSprite.ts | 16-136 | Converts 2D sprite pixels to 3D voxel mesh |

**Palette Helpers:**

| Type | File | Lines | Details |
|------|------|-------|---------|
| `BLOCK_COLORS` | blocks.ts | 71-99 | Float RGB for all block types |
| `MATERIAL_PALETTES` | spritePixels.ts | 47-55 | Material tiers (wood, stone, diamond, etc.) |
